<section class="cc-compare"><div class="cc-compare__inner"><div class="cc-compare__hd"><span class="pp-eyebrow" style="color:#81AB4C">Compare Privacy Options</span><h2 class="cc-compare__title">Casper Clear vs. frosted film vs. one-way mirror</h2><p class="cc-compare__sub">Casper does a very specific job: screen-only privacy for glass offices. Here's how that differs from conventional privacy film.</p></div><div class="cc-compare__wrap"><table class="cc-compare__table" aria-label="Casper Clear frosted film and one-way mirror comparison"><thead><tr><th class="cc-compare__th cc-compare__th--series">Privacy Factor</th><th class="cc-compare__th">Casper Clear</th><th class="cc-compare__th">Frosted Film</th><th class="cc-compare__th">One-Way Mirror</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="cc-compare__row"><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--name"><span class="cc-compare__series-name">Screens visible from outside</span></td><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--stat">No</td><td class="cc-compare__td">No (all content blocked)</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Yes</td></tr><tr class="cc-compare__row"><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--name"><span class="cc-compare__series-name">People visible from outside</span></td><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--stat">Yes</td><td class="cc-compare__td">No</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Partially</td></tr><tr class="cc-compare__row"><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--name"><span class="cc-compare__series-name">Daytime privacy</span></td><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--stat">Screen-only</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Full</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Partial</td></tr><tr class="cc-compare__row"><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--name"><span class="cc-compare__series-name">Night privacy</span></td><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--stat">Screen-only</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Full</td><td class="cc-compare__td">None</td></tr><tr class="cc-compare__row"><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--name"><span class="cc-compare__series-name">Open office aesthetic</span></td><td class="cc-compare__td cc-compare__td--stat">Preserved</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Blocked</td><td class="cc-compare__td">Partial</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="cc-compare__note">Casper Clear is intended for screen privacy on compatible LED and LCD displays. It does not cloak printed materials, whiteboards, e-ink, OLED, or the room itself. Warranty terms vary by commercial project; confirm with Window Film Philadelphia.</p><div class="cc-compare__cta"><a href="/contact/" class="pp-btn pp-btn--primary" style="background:#81AB4C;border-color:#81AB4C;color:#fff">Talk to our team about Casper for your office</a></div></div></section>

